hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Yahya bin Yahya Laisi ne, unhon ne Malik bin Anas se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne aik din namaz dair kar di to Urwa bin Zubair un ke paas dakhil hue aur unhein khabar di ke Mughira bin Shoba ne aik din namaz dair kar di jabke wo Kufa mein they to Abu Masud Ansari un ke paas dakhil hue aur kaha ke ye kya hai aey Mughira, kya tumhein malum nahi ke Jibraeel utre aur namaz padhi phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, phir namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, phir namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, phir namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, phir namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, phir kaha ke isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai. To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne kaha ke jo tum bayan karte ho aey Urwa use samjho, kya Jibraeel hi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye namaz ka waqt qayam kya. Urwa ne kaha ke isi tarah Bashir bin Abi Masud Ansari apne walid se bayan karte they."
"2","Urwa ne kaha ke mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr padhte they jabke suraj un ke hujre mein hota, is se pehle ke wo zahir ho."
"3","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se subah ki namaz ke waqt ke bare mein pucha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se khamosh rahe yahan tak ke jab agle din hua to subah Fajr nikalte hi padhi phir agle din subah roshni ke baad padhi phir kaha ke namaz ke waqt ke bare mein puchhne wala kahan hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main hazir hun ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne farmaya ke in dono ke darmiyan waqt hai."
"4","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Amra bint Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah padhte they aur auratein apni chadaron mein lipti hui laut tin, andhere ki wajah se pehchani na jatin."
"5","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se aur Busr bin Saeed se aur Aaraj se riwayat kya, sab unhein Abu Huraira se bayan karte hain, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo subah ki aik rakat suraj nikalne se pehle pa le us ne subah pa li, aur jo Asr ki aik rakat suraj doobne se pehle pa le us ne Asr pa li."
"6","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi Abdullah bin Umar ke azad karda se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne apne karkunon ko likha ke mere nazdeek tumhara sab se ahem mamla namaz hai, phir jo use mehfooz rakhe aur us ki hifazat kare us ne apna deen mehfooz rakha, aur jo use zaya kare wo us ke siwa ko zyada zaya karne wala hai. Phir likha ke Zuhr padho jab saya aik haath ho, yahan tak ke tum mein se aik ka saya us ke barabar ho, aur Asr jab suraj buland safed saaf ho, is qadr ke sawaar do ya teen farsakh chale suraj doobne se pehle, aur Maghrib jab suraj doob jaye, aur Isha jab shafaq chhup jaye raat ke tihaai tak, phir jo soya to us ki aankh na soe, jo soya to us ki aankh na soe, jo soya to us ki aankh na soe, aur subah jab sitare zahir ghane hon."
"7","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Abu Musa ko likha ke Zuhr padho jab suraj dhal jaye, aur Asr jab suraj safed saaf ho is se pehle ke us mein zardi dakhil ho, aur Maghrib jab suraj doob jaye, aur Isha ko muaakhar karo jab tak so na jao, aur subah padho jab sitare zahir ghane hon aur is mein mufassal mein se do lambi suratein padho."
"8","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Abu Musa Ashari ko likha ke Asr padho jab suraj safed saaf ho is qadr ke sawaar teen farsakh chale, aur Isha padho tumhare aur raat ke tihaai ke darmiyan jo hai, phir agar muaakhar karo to aadhi raat tak, aur ghafilon mein se na ho jao."
"9","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazid bin Ziyad se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Rafi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ke azad karda se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Huraira se namaz ke waqt ke bare mein pucha to Abu Huraira ne kaha ke main tumhein batata hun, Zuhr padho jab tumhara saya tumhare barabar ho, aur Asr jab tumhara saya tum se dugna ho, aur Maghrib jab suraj doob jaye, aur Isha tumhare aur raat ke tihaai ke darmiyan jo hai, aur subah andhere mein padho, yani ghalas."
"10","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Asr padhte phir insan Bani Amr bin Auf ki taraf nikalta to unhein Asr padhta pata."
"11","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Asr padhte phir jane wala Quba ki taraf jata aur un ke paas aata jabke suraj buland hota."
"12","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine logon ko na paya magar wo Zuhr dair se padhte they."
"13","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail bin Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Aqeel bin Abi Talib ka qaleen juma ke din masjid ki maghribi deewar ki taraf bichha dekhta tha, phir jab deewar ka saya pure qaleen ko dhaanp leta to Umar bin Khattab nikalte aur juma padhate. Malik Abu Suhail ke walid ne kaha ke phir hum juma ki namaz ke baad laute aur chasht ka qailula karte."
"14","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Amr bin Yahya Mazni se, unhon ne Ibn Abi Sulait se riwayat kya ke Usman bin Affan ne Madina mein juma padha aur Malal mein Asr padhi. Malik ne kaha ke ye jaldi aur tez safar ki wajah se tha."
"15","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo namaz ki aik rakat pa le us ne namaz pa li."
"16","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar bin Khattab kehte they ke jab tum se rakat faut ho gai to tum se sajda faut ho gaya."
"17","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar aur Zaid bin Sabit kehte they ke jo rakat pa le us ne sajda pa liya."
"18","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein riwayat pahunchi ke Abu Huraira kehte they ke jo rakat pa le us ne sajda pa liya, aur jis se Ummul Quran ki qirat faut ho gai us se bahut bhalai faut ho gai."
"19","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke duluk ash-shams us ka dhalna hai."
"20","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar dene wale ne khabar di ke Abdullah bin Abbas kehte they ke duluk ash-shams jab saya laut aae, aur ghasaq al-lail raat ka jama hona aur us ka andhera hai."
"21","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis se Asr ki namaz faut ho gai goya us ke ghar wale aur maal chheen liye gae."
"22","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab Asr ki namaz se laute aur aik shakhs se mile jo Asr mein hazir na hua tha, to Umar ne kaha ke tumhein Asr ki namaz se kis ne roka, to shakhs ne un se uzr bayan kya, to Umar ne kaha ke tum ne kam naapa. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke har cheez ke liye poora aur kam naapna kaha jata hai."
"23","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke namaz padhne wala namaz padhta hai jabke us ka waqt us se faut nahi hua, lekin jo us ke waqt mein se us se faut ho gaya wo us ke ghar walon aur maal se bada hai, ya kaha ke afzal hai. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke jo waqt pa le jabke safar mein ho phir namaz bhool kar ya bhula kar muaakhar kare yahan tak ke apne ghar walon ke paas aa jaye, ke agar wo apne ghar walon ke paas waqt mein aaya to muqeem ki namaz padhe, aur agar wo aaya jabke waqt chala gaya to musafir ki namaz padhe kyunke wo usi ki qaza karta hai jo us par tha. Malik ne kaha ke yehi hukm hai jis par maine logon aur hamare shehar ke ahl ilm ko paya. Aur Malik ne kaha ke shafaq wo surkhi hai jo maghrib mein hai, phir jab surkhi chali jaye to Isha ki namaz wajib ho gai aur Maghrib ke waqt se nikal gai."
"24","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar par behoshi chha gai aur aql jati rahi aur namaz qaza na ki. Malik ne kaha ke ye hamare khayal mein is liye ke waqt chala gaya tha, aur Allah zyada janta hai, aur jo waqt mein hosh mein aae wo namaz padhe."
"25","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Khaibar se laute to raat chale yahan tak ke jab raat ke aakhri hisse mein they to dera dala aur Bilal se kaha ke hamare liye subah ki nigeh-bani karo. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap ke sahaba so gae aur Bilal ne nigeh-bani ki jitni us ke liye muqaddar ki gai, phir apni sawari se tek lagayi jabke Fajr ke samne they, to us ki aankhein ghalib aa gain, phir na Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaage, na Bilal, na sawar jamaat mein se koi, yahan tak ke suraj ne unhein maar diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghabra kar jaage aur Bilal se kaha ke ya Rasulullah meri jaan ko usi ne pakda jis ne Aap ki jaan ko pakda. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha ke sawariyan aage badhao. To unhon ne sawariyan uthain aur kuchh aage badhe, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bilal ko hukm diya aur us ne namaz ki iqamat kahi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein subah padhai, phir jab namaz poori ki to kaha ke jo namaz bhool jaye use chahiye jab yad aae padhe, kyunke Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehta hai ke mere zikr ke liye namaz qayam karo."
"26","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Makka ke raaste mein aik raat dera dala aur Bilal ko zimma diya ke unhein namaz ke liye jagaye, phir Bilal so gae aur sab so gae yahan tak ke jaage jabke suraj un par nikal chuka tha, to qoum jaagi jabke ghabrai hui thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke sawar hon yahan tak ke us wadi se niklein aur kaha ke ye wadi hai jis mein shaitan hai. Phir sawar hue yahan tak ke us wadi se nikle, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke utrein aur wuzu karein, aur Bilal ko hukm diya ke namaz ki azan de ya iqamat kahe, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko namaz padhai phir un ki taraf mutawajjeh hue jabke un ki ghabrahat dekh chuke they, to farmaya ke aey logon Allah ne hamari roohein qabz kar lin aur agar chahta to unhein humari taraf is ke ilawa waqt mein lauta deta, phir jab tum mein se koi namaz se so jaye ya use bhool jaye phir us ki taraf ghabra kar aae to use padhe jaisa waqt mein padhta tha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu Bakr ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha ke shaitan Bilal ke paas aaya jabke wo khade namaz padh rahe they aur use lita diya aur use sulata raha jaisa bache ko sulaya jata hai yahan tak ke wo so gae. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bilal ko bulaya aur Bilal ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko waisa hi bataya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr ko bataya tha, to Abu Bakr ne kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke Aap Allah ke Rasool hain."
"27","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai, phir jab garmi sakht ho to namaz thandi karke padho. Aur kaha ke aag ne apne Rab se shikayat ki aur kaha ke aey mere Rab mera kuchh hissa kuchh ko kha gaya, to use har saal mein do saanson ki ijazat di, sardi mein aik saans aur garmi mein aik saans."
"28","Hum se Malik ne, unhon ne Abdullah bin Yazid Aswad bin Sufyan ke azad karda se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se aur Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sauban se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab garmi sakht ho to namaz thandi karke padho kyunke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai. Aur bayan kya ke aag ne apne Rab se shikayat ki to use har saal mein do saanson ki ijazat di, sardi mein aik saans aur garmi mein aik saans."
"29","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab garmi sakht ho to namaz thandi karke padho kyunke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai."
"30","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo is darkht mein se khae wo hamari masjidon ke qareeb na aae, humein lehsan ki boo se takleef deta hai."
"31","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Mujabbar se riwayat kya ke wo Salim bin Abdullah ko dekhte they ke jab insan ko namaz mein munh dhaanpta dekhte to kapda us ke munh se zor se kheench lete yahan tak ke use us ke munh se utar dete."
